Z||000000||mope||02-20-2001||10:21 PM||||So far these are the only shows i know of, Haze told me about them. Can i get confirmation of these shows and dates plus any additional shows in the area. I am willing to travel a few hours for a show.<P>May 31-june 4th    dells<BR>Middle of may      Twin Lakes<BR>June 11th (approx) ??? (all pontia show)<BR>April???            Archie's<P>when is the one by mcdonalds? (fierorama)<BR>FYI Fierorama is the reason i wanted and got a fiero!<P>Lemme know of some other dates~<P>thanks fellas<P>m0pe<BR><P>------------------<BR>=======================<P>-= Silver 86 GT, being restored, and following major things to be done: Mr. Mike's Leather, new steering wheel, paint repair, ebrake repair, take apart and clean everything! <A HREF="http://www.mastergraphics.cjb.net" TARGET=_blank>www.mastergraphics.cjb.net</A>  <A HREF="http://www.mope.cjb.net" TARGET=_blank>www.mope.cjb.net</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Haze_Performance||02-20-2001||10:30 PM||||<B><I>April 21 - Club Meeting - at the shop of V-8 Archie in Barrington, IL.  Meeting starts at 1:00pm.  V-8 Archie will update us with the latest information regarding the world of Fiero V-8's and kit cars.<P>May 5 - Fiero Fest at Twin Lakes Fiero in Paxton, IL.  Join other Fiero club's from around the midwest at this Fiero display and open house.  10:00am-3:00pm - join us for lunch, door prizes and picking up recycled Fiero Parts.<P>May 5 - 5th annual Wal Mart charity car show. - Auburn, Indiana - just off of state Rd. 8 and I-69, exit 129.  Two awards in the Best Fiero Class.<P>June 1-4 - Wisconsin Fiero Fanatics’ 10th annual "Dell’s Run 2001"/ Midwest Fiero Regionals - FOUR days of Fiero Fun -Chula Vista Resort/Wisconsin Dells - 800-388-4782.<P>June 24 - Illinois Pontiac/Oakland Club’s 4th annual Trip To the Village All GM Car Show - Village Pontiac - Naperville, IL at the corner of Ogden Ave. and Aurora Ave. Two Fiero classes: Stock/Modified. <P>August 11 - El Paso, IL <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/1930/elpasoshow.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/1930/elpasoshow.html</A>  <P>Sept 9 - Fierorama - It takes place at 2111 Midwest Rd, Oak Brook, IL, 60521. Right next door to McDonalds.</I></B> <P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">      </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>PFF Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery</A><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 02-21-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000002||MikeSchaefer||02-21-2001||12:49 AM||||August 11th:  El Paso, IL <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/1930/elpasoshow.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/1930/elpasoshow.html</A> <BR>I hope to see everyone there,<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||6
